capabilities in the lattice package for exploratory or presentation 
graphics of grouped data. It also provides sophisticated methods of 
assessing parameter precision using Markov Chain Monte Carlo samples 
from the posterior distribution of the parameters and for hypothesis 
testing using a parametric bootstrap to derive a reference distribution 
